// Picture 234 (Nov 13, 2026, Loudjier: "A mix of V2 A+D. Make both cars fit in the screen" → "Build"):
// the car stands in front of our soft gold V (like the website's type tiles), year in the logo font, heart to save,
// the row's badge in a ring floating on the seam, price with new/used, and a green monthly estimate pill.
// Two cards fill the screen exactly and each swipe moves two (one per screen with big text).
