// Big car cards (picture 129 A, Oct 24, 2026, Loudjier: "the card should be bigger… we are not copying them,
// we follow the trend and are a better competitor"). Used in Search and on the "See all" pages.
// Big floating car, price + payment estimate, fits-your-plan tag, 3 quick facts (EPA, NHTSA, our data),
// See details / Find for sale near you, and Compare (up to 3 cars, then the Compare screen).
